  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering the state and municipal institutions and civil society to promote dialogue and a culture of peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be implemented over a period of 36 months, starting in March 2026 and running until March 2029. The projects primary objective is to foster trust and collaboration between government institutions and civil society in ten cities and districts prone to conflict. This will be achieved through the establishment of inclusive dialogue platforms, the provision of legal support and capacity-building initiatives, and the promotion of participatory governance, social cohesion and human r</narrative>
  </description>
